<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Contacto y Sugerencias | SelfHostDeck</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 10vh auto auto auto; /* 10vh arriba le da la altura natural perfecta */
   
    }

    .volver {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #38bdf8 !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .volver:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .sub {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .box {
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .box h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .box p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .box p.single {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .box a.mail {
      color: #38bdf8;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .box a.mail:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #0284c7;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #0369a1;
    }
    .btn-linkedin {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #0a66c2;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-linkedin:hover {
      background: #004182;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <main class="container">
    <a href="/" class="volver">&larr; Volver al catálogo</a>

    <h1>Contacto y Sugerencias</h1>
    <p class="sub">¿Conoces un proyecto open-source que deba estar indexado o tienes propuestas de mejora?</p>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>Sugerir una herramienta</h2>
      <p>Puedes proponer nuevos repositorios o reportar incidencias directamente en GitHub.</p>
      <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
        Abrir propuesta en GitHub &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>Contacto directo</h2>
      <p class="single">Para consultas generales o dudas técnicas: <a href="mailto:contacto@selfhostdeck.com" class="mail">contacto@selfhostdeck.com</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <h2>Perfil profesional</h2>
      <p>Conecta para colaboraciones, networking o proyectos profesionales.</p>
      <a 
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/denis-campayo-dev" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer" 
        class="btn-linkedin"
      >
        Ver perfil en LinkedIn &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>